# Mojo / Python interop

`agentd` is the Mojo agent runtime with embedded CPython. It eagerly loads and
caches the real Python contract, then executes its composition root in-process.

| Need | Owner |
| --- | --- |
| CPython lifecycle/import | `ai-agent-runtime/src/host/interop/python_runtime.mojo` |
| mirrored loaders and object registry | `ai-agent-runtime/src/contracts/` |
| private HTTP/IPC and health | `ai-agent-runtime/src/host/transport/` |
| composition root | `ai-agent-contract/src/ai_orchestrator/bootstrap/` |
| agents, graph, RAG, tools | `ai-agent-contract/src/ai_orchestrator/` |

Use `Python.import_module()` and configure `MOJO_PYTHON` plus
`MOJO_PYTHON_LIBRARY`. Do not use subprocesses, `exec`, `eval`, or a second
Mojo implementation of Python agent behavior. Run
`scripts/generate_agent_contract_loaders.py` after adding, moving or deleting a
Python contract module.
